-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Banner County came in under 90% of normal in February to March in 39 of 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 26% of normal in November to December and 131% in July to August. So far in 2026 it shows 29% in January to February and 40% in April to May. Grid 25905 had its driest year in 2012 at 43%.</p>"}
